<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/stephen-martin> <http://schema.org/description> "Stephen Martin joined the Civil Nuclear Constabulary as Deputy Chief Constable on 9 May 2022. He had previously been a police officer in Northern Ireland for nearly 34 years, retiring as the T/Deputy Chief Constable in January 2020 when he was responsible for corporate governance, professional standards, organisational change and performance. Having held three separate ACC portfolios, Stephen was variously responsible for: front line uniform and detective policing; protective services; serious and organised crime; intelligence and specialist operations; as well as a range of other operational and support policy areas."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/stephen-martin> .
