<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/geoff-thompson> <http://schema.org/description> "Stanley Beresford Thompson and Violet Adriana Thompson migrated from Barbados and Guyana respectively as part of the post-war rebuilding of the mother country. My father fought in the second world war and distinguished himself with medals of valour. My mother came over as a nurse as so many who were encouraged to improve their life chances and one day return back home."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/geoff-thompson> .
