<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/hannah-meyer> <http://schema.org/description> "Hannah joined HMPPS in October 2019 to establish a new Reducing Reoffending Directorate, building on her experience of strategic policy making, cross-Government and local partnership working and programme delivery. Her directorate, renamed to Reducing Reoffending, Partnerships & Accommodation in 2020, works across Government, with the wider public and voluntary sector to reduce reoffending, primarily through improving accommodation, employment and substance misuse outcomes for prison leavers."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/hannah-meyer> .
