<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/theresa-may> <http://schema.org/description> "Theresa May was Prime Minister from 13 July 2016 to 24 July 2019. She served as Home Secretary from May 2010 until July 2016. She was elected Conservative MP for Maidenhead in May 1997."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/theresa-may> .
