<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/clare-barclay> <http://schema.org/description> "Dame Clare Barclay DBE is President of Enterprise and Industry EMEA at Microsoft, appointed in November 2024. Prior to this Clare spent 4 years as CEO of Microsoft UK, leading through a period of significant transformation and growth. She is responsible for driving Microsoft’s growth ambitions and driving AI industry innovation across the UK, Europe, Middle East and Africa."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/clare-barclay> .
