<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/pat-mcfadden> <http://schema.org/description> "Pat McFadden was appointed Secretary of State for Work and Pensions on 5 September 2025. He was previously Chancellor of the Duchy of Lancaster between 5 July 2024 and 5 September 2025 and Minister for Intergovernmental Relations between 5 September 2024 and 6 September 2025."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/pat-mcfadden> .
