<https://www.gov.uk/government/people/peter-welch> <http://schema.org/description> "Peter Welch is responsible for the delivery of corporate services at RWM, all of which facilitate our mission to deliver a geological disposal facility and provide radioactive waste management solutions. As such, Peter’s portfolio includes our finance, digital and IT, risk and assurance, performance and governance and knowledge and data teams."@en <https://www.gov.uk/government/people/peter-welch> .
